<title>TOGO:  SOCCER-TOGO BEAT TANZANIA 2-1 IN AFRICA CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOGO BEAT TANZANIA 2-1 IN AFRICA CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togo beat Tanzania 2-1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>in an African Nations Cup soccer qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Togo - Salu Tadju (17th minute), Abalo Dosseh (57th)</p>
<p>Tanzania - Lazaro Samieh (72nd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
